Rule 2 (broadcast compatibility for input tensor shapes)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor} |= ndim(v_1) = 0 ∨ ndim(v_2) = 0 ∨ ∀i ∈ [0, if ndim(v_1) < ndim(v_2) then ndim(v_1) - 1 else ndim(v_2) - 1] : shape(v_1, ndim(v_1) - 1 - i) = shape(v_2, ndim(v_2) - 1 - i) ∨ shape(v_1, ndim(v_1) - 1 - i) = 1 ∨ shape(v_2, ndim(v_2) - 1 - i) = 1
>>
Rule 3 (input tensors should have non-complex numeric dtypes)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor} |= dtype_(v_1) ≤ 8 ∧ dtype_(v_2) ≤ 8
