Rule 6 (broadcasting compatibility when second tensor has fewer or equal dimensions)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor} |= ndim(v_1) < ndim(v_2) ∨ ndim(v_2) = 0 ∨ ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(v_2) - 1] : shape(v_2, ndim(v_2) - 1 - i) = 1 ∨ shape(v_1, ndim(v_1) - 1 - i) = 1 ∨ shape(v_1, ndim(v_1) - 1 - i) = shape(v_2, ndim(v_2) - 1 - i)
