Rule 10 (last dimension broadcast compatibility of non-scalar inputs)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor} |= ndim(v_1) = 0 ∨ ndim(v_2) = 0 ∨ shape(v_1, ndim(v_1) - 1) = 1 ∨ shape(v_2, ndim(v_2) - 1) = 1 ∨ shape(v_1, ndim(v_1) - 1) = shape(v_2, ndim(v_2) - 1)
>>
Rule 11 (trailing dimension broadcast compatibility of non-scalar inputs)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor} |= ndim(v_1) = 0 ∨ ndim(v_2) = 0 ∨ shape(v_1, ndim(v_1) - 1) = shape(v_2, ndim(v_2) - 1) ∨ shape(v_1, ndim(v_1) - 1) = 1 ∨ shape(v_2, ndim(v_2) - 1) = 1
>>
Rule 12 (penultimate dimension broadcast compatibility for inputs of rank at least 2)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor} |= ndim(v_1) < 2 ∨ ndim(v_2) < 2 ∨ shape(v_1, ndim(v_1) - 2) = shape(v_2, ndim(v_2) - 2) ∨ shape(v_1, ndim(v_1) - 2) = 1 ∨ shape(v_2, ndim(v_2) - 2) = 1
